{"id":839,"skill":"listening","title":"Westley public libray membership application form","type":2,"quizType":3,"durationMin":60,"thumbnail":"bba4e94d-1911-4bf6-ae51-60f90b6cd719","thumbnailUrl":"/assets/thumbs-listening/839.jpg","totalSubmitted":3340,"voteCount":1,"isPublic":true,"quizCode":"","dateUpdated":"2026-05-08T23:40:31.493176+07:00","tags":[{"id":35,"code":"section_1","title":"Section 1"},{"id":10,"code":"","title":"Short Answer"},{"id":3,"code":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE_MANY","title":"Multiple Choice (Many Answers)"},{"id":6,"code":"FILL_BLANK","title":"Gap Filling"}],"parts":[{"id":1066,"index":1,"title":"vol 18 sec 1","transcriptHtml":"<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Hello, I'm new in the area and I'd like to join the library please.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> That's no problem. Let me get an application form. Here we are. Now all we have to do is fill this in and then I'll get you to sign and you'll be a member.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Great</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Now then. What's your full name?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Peter Adrian Camden.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> How do you spell Camden?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> {[<strong>C-A-M-D-E-N.</strong>][1]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> C-A-M-D-E-N</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Yes, that's right.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Right, and what's your address?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> {[<strong>Flat 553 Green street, Finsbury</strong>.][2]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Ok. Got that. That's near here isn't it?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Yes, just 5 minutes walk.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> What's the post code?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> {[7424.. I..I mean, sorry, <strong>7 4 3 4</strong>.][3]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Got that now. Now, can you tell me your date of birth?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> {[<strong>8th of July, 1976.</strong>][4]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> And, what's your telephone number?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Well, I don't have a home number but I've got a mobile.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> That'll do fine.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> It's o six six three four nine eight two seven four six. Did you get that?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Some of it. Can you say it again?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> {[<strong>The code's 06634 and the number's then 982 746</strong>.][5]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Right. That's almost it. Now I need some kind of identification to prove where you live. Do you have a driving license or a passport or anything like that?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> I'm afraid that everything I have, has got my old address on it. Do you need it now?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> No, not now, but you won't be able to take anything out until we see that.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Wait a minute. I've got a letter addressed to me here that arrived this morning. Will that do?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Oh yes. That's a good idea. That will be fine. Let's look. Ok. Well, that's that finished.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Could I ask you a few questions? The Council that runs the library is running a survey to find out what kind of books people prefer so that they can direct their buying.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Yeah, no problem.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> OK. So, what type of books do you like?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> {[<strong>Well, I'm very keen on mysteries</strong>.][6]} You know, when a detective is trying to find out who did the murder. {[<strong>Historical novels interest me too</strong>.][7]} Romance never! My sister loves them but they bore me to tears. {[<strong>I quite like books on animals too</strong>.][8]} I get them out sometimes. Not science fiction either. Too weird.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Well, I think that's it then.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Good. Oh, do you charge anything?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> {[<strong>The library is free</strong>][9]} unless you want to rent out some of our videos or DVDs.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> How much is that?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> {[Well, we rent videos out for four dollars each and<strong> DVDs are six dollars. You must leave us a deposit for $60 as well. That's returnable of course</strong>.][10]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> I don't think I'll get any of those just yet. Can I pay later?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Sure, just give the money in when you're ready to rent them out.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Well thanks very much. You've been very helpful. I might take a book out now for the weekend, if that's OK?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Will:</strong> Go ahead.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Peter:</strong> Well, goodbye</p>","transcriptSegments":[{"paragraph":0,"sentences":[{"id":645375,"text":"Hello, I’m new in the area and I’d like to join the library please.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":"Peter"}]},{"paragraph":1,"sentences":[{"id":645392,"text":"That’s no problem.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":"Will"},{"id":645396,"text":"Let me get an application form.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":645403,"text":"Here we are.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":645407,"text":"Now all we have to do is fill this in and then I’ll get you to sign and you’ll be a member.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":2,"sentences":[{"id":645430,"text":"Great","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":"Peter"}]},{"paragraph":3,"sentences":[{"id":645434,"text":"Now then.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":"Will"},{"id":645437,"text":"What’s your full name?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":4,"sentences":[{"id":645443,"text":"Peter Adrian Camden.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":"Peter"}]},{"paragraph":5,"sentences":[{"id":645448,"text":"How do you spell Camden?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":"Will"}]},{"paragraph":6,"sentences":[{"id":645456,"text":"C-A-M-D-E-N.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":"Peter"}]},{"paragraph":7,"sentences":[{"id":645463,"text":"C-A-M-D-E-N","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":"Will"}]},{"paragraph":8,"sentences":[{"id":645470,"text":"Yes, that’s right.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":"Peter"}]},{"paragraph":9,"sentences":[{"id":645475,"text":"Right, and what’s your address?","from":null,"to":n